

# Explain-back gate: fill these in your own words. Lines starting with # are ignored by git.
# Suggested layout: a short summary line on top, then a blank line, then:
#
# What changed:  (what did you change, in one or two sentences?)
# Why:           (what problem does it solve?)
# How it could break / how to undo:  (what might go wrong? how do we undo it?)
#
# Branch: <name>/TEL-<id>-<slug>. Never push to main, open a PR.
